    {
      "id": "q_002",
      "question": "Who are the parents of Martha J (mother of Jimmie Jewel Neal, born approximately 1859 in Georgia)?",
      "rationale": "q_001 established Martha J as Jimmie's mother (probable) and that she is documented under at least three married surnames across her life: 'Landham' (a widow's styling at her 31 Jul 1879 marriage to James M Neal in Hill County, Texas — a_002; the marriage this styling refers to has not itself been found or dated), 'Neal' (from that 1879 marriage, Jimmie's father), and 'Hamby' (a later, 1888 marriage, after Neal). Two leads bear on her parentage: (a) a Smith County, Texas marriage record shows a bride named 'M J Wood' marrying 'W F Lanham' on 7 Jan 1869 — the earliest marriage record found for her so far, but nothing yet establishes this was her FIRST marriage; and (b) a pre-existing FamilySearch tree source (uncited, no attached record) places an 'M M Wood' household in the 1860 U.S. Census in Blount County, Alabama, matching Martha's birth year (~1859) and birthplace (Georgia). Neither lead has been corroborated by a record naming Martha's parents directly.",
      "selection_basis": "objective_decomposition",
      "priority": "high",
      "status": "open",
      "depends_on": [
        "q_001"
      ],
